MV-Adapter memory patch for 11-12 GB cards (iamar city, the build host's RTX 2080 Ti, 2026-10-14;
the iamar-models mesh archive (not public) tools/mesh3d/mvadapter_11gb.patch). Against huanngzh/MV-Adapter
commit 4277e0018232bac82bb2c103caf0893cedb711be. The pipeline cloned the reference
hidden-state cache every step, doubling its memory; passing it uncloned lets four 768 px
views fit in 9.7 GB. Apply once in your clone:
    git -C <MV-Adapter clone> apply <kit>/gpu/patches/mvadapter_11gb.patch
kit/gpu/gpu_check.py --stage views reports whether the clone is patched.

